  "notes": "Pinout diagram of ESP32-PICO-KIT (ESP32-PICO-D4, micro-USB at bottom centre). Silkscreen text printed beside each pad is recorded first in functions where it differs from the label. Rows for pads silkscreened 32, 33, 14, 12, 13, 15, 2, 4, 0 (left) and 35, 34 (right) have no GPIOxx pill in the diagram, so the silkscreen number is used as the label (rule 5 board-name fallback) and all printed pills go to functions. The pad silkscreened EN is labelled CHIP_PU. \"HS1_STORE\" copied as printed. Wave (PWM) symbols omitted."
}
